>
> I'm curious... are tanru strict in implying that the set must
> be a subset of the modificand?

Not at all. For example {cinfo kalte}, "lion hunter" does not imply
that the hunter must be a lion. It might be a person that hunts
lions. This does not mean that "lion hunter" is a metaphor,
of course.

